### Plan file structure template

```markdown
---
name: <Plan Name>
overview: <1–2 sentence summary>
todos:
  - id: <slug>
    content: <what to do>
    status: pending
isProject: false
---

# <Plan Name>

## Architecture overview
<mermaid diagram or prose>

## Constraints
<bullet list of hard rules>

---

## Parallelism analysis

| Todo | Files touched | Dependencies | Track |
|------|---------------|-------------|-------|
| <id> | <file list> | <dependent-on or "none"> | <A/B/...> |

Track A: <description>
Track B: <description> (can run in parallel with A)

---

## Implementation detail

### 1. <File or area>
<method signatures, field tables, code snippets, logging requirements>

### 2. <File or area>
...

### N. New test file: <path>
| Test | What to verify |
|------|----------------|
| ... | ... |

---

## Validation checklist

### A. <Area>
- [ ] <specific verifiable requirement>

### B. <Area>
- [ ] ...

---

## Implementation Agent prompt

\```text
<see template above>
\```

## Validation Agent prompt

\```text
<see template above>
\```
```

